From: Nex package maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] config: add the transient UAPI configuration tier
Source: Nex
Upstream: not submitted; suitable for upstream review

Fish already combines user, administrator, and vendor conf.d directories by
filename, with the first directory winning and empty files acting as masks.
Add /run/fish/conf.d between the administrator and vendor directories so a
machine can apply temporary configuration without changing /etc or /usr.

diff --git a/share/config.fish b/share/config.fish
--- a/share/config.fish
+++ b/share/config.fish
@@ -214,9 +214,11 @@ if status is-interactive || set -qgx __fish_force_load_default_theme
 end
 
 # As last part of initialization, source the conf directories.
-# Implement precedence (User > Admin > Extra (e.g. vendors) > Fish) by basically doing "basename".
+# Implement precedence (User > Admin > Transient > Extra (e.g. vendors) > Fish)
+# by basically doing "basename".
+set -l __fish_runtime_confdir /run/fish/conf.d
 set -l sourcelist
-for file in $__fish_config_dir/conf.d/*.fish $__fish_sysconf_dir/conf.d/*.fish $__fish_vendor_confdirs/*.fish
+for file in $__fish_config_dir/conf.d/*.fish $__fish_sysconf_dir/conf.d/*.fish $__fish_runtime_confdir/*.fish $__fish_vendor_confdirs/*.fish
     set -l basename (string replace -r '^.*/' '' -- $file)
     contains -- $basename $sourcelist
     and continue
